    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in the North County Dublin town of Balbriggan, this is an exceptional SMALL scheme of A-Rated of homes in a highly sought and exclusive setting.\r\n\r\nEach 3 bedroom duplex apartment comes with many extras including timber and tiled flooring to entrance hall, utility, kitchen / dining and bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThey offer an abundance of natural light, expertly designed and high specification finish throughout:\r\n\r\n\r\nHigh energy efficiency and thermal comfort\r\n\r\nHeating by Air-to-Water heat pump\r\n\r\nRadiators to ground floor and first floor\r\n\r\nThermostatically controlled central heating; dual zone\r\n\r\nHigh standard of insulation in floors, walls & roofs\r\n\r\nAll walls & ceilings painted\r\n\r\nGenerous Electrical Specification\r\n\r\nHigh quality timber doors throughout with selected high quality ironmongery\r\n\r\nContemporary high specification kitchen\r\n\r\nSeparate fitted utility room\r\n\r\nHigh quality sanitary ware throughout\r\n\r\nTiled bathroom & ensuite (wet areas)\r\n\r\nExternal Specification:\r\n\r\nPrivate balcony\r\n\r\nCommunal gardens\r\n\r\nInfrastructure for charging of electric vehicles (charging packs not included)\r\n\r\n** Qualifies for First Home Scheme & Help To Buy Scheme**\r\n\r\n5 x three bedroom, duplex apartments\r\n5 x one bedroom, own door apartments\r\n\r\nLocated within a short walk of train station, schools and beautiful beach\r\n\r\nAll units qualify for Help to Buy & First Home Schemes.\r\n\r\nAll enquiries: Thomas Byrne Auctioneer & Valuer, 041 983 2927"
      },
